# Switch Statement
        -> Needs Break;
        -> More Lines may cause more errors
        -> Used Mainly For Actions (print,updating)


## Switch Expression
        ->No Break Needed;
        ->It Returns the value Directly

## Multiple Case Labels
        -> Runs More than one Case
        -> Different inputs → same output

## Yield Keyword
        -> It used Only inside the Switch Expression
        -> It return values from the case

## Switch expression rules
        -> Every Case must return value
        -> default case is mandatory

# Ternary Operator
        -> Its One Line Conditional Experssion
        -> Syntax:
                condition ? valueIfTrue : valueIfFalse;

# Break Label
        -> A label is just a name followed by :
        -> Placed Before the Block or Loop
        -> Normal Break Breaks inner loop
        -> Break Label Breaks outter Loop